<title>GERMANY: Daimler to finalise restructuring plans Jan 23.</title>
<headline>Daimler to finalise restructuring plans Jan 23.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG's supervisory board will meet on January 23 to finalise plans for a comprehensive restructuring of the company, a Daimler spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Daimler has for months debated several restructuring options and has previously said it hoped to make up its mind early next year.</p>
</text>
